# Line endings are part of the contract here, not a preference.
#
# Windows checks out CRLF by default, and several things in this repo compare
# bytes rather than lines: the JSON Schema is regenerated and diffed against the
# committed file, specs are emitted and re-parsed, and the whole project rests
# on the same inputs producing the same output everywhere. A checkout that
# rewrote line endings would fail those comparisons on Windows alone, for a
# reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Media is committed by CI and must never be touched by any filter.
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
